### Consume Course Content
GET http://localhost:3001/api/v1/courses/1/consume
Accept: application/json

###

### Track Video Progress
POST http://localhost:3001/api/v1/progress/video
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "student_id": 3,
  "video_id": 1,
  "watch_time_seconds": 600,
  "completion_percent": 50
}

###

### Submit Quiz Attempt
POST http://localhost:3001/api/v1/quizzes/1/attempts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "student_id": 3,
  "score": 85
}

###

### Get AI Quiz Summary
GET http://localhost:3001/api/v1/quizzes/1/summary
Accept: application/json

###

### Submit AI Doubt Query
POST http://localhost:3001/api/v1/ai/doubt
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenant_id": 1,
  "student_id": 3,
  "course_id": 1,
  "question_text": "I don't understand how React context re-renders work. Can you explain?"
}

###

### Checkout / Buy Course (80/20 Revenue Split Test)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/v1/payments/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "course_id": 1,
  "coupon_code": "WELCOME10"
}
